## LifeLock Features

LifeLock organizes its features into five pillars. Availability of specific features varies by plan (Core, Advanced, Total).

### Fraud Protection & Recovery

- **Identity Theft Reimbursement:** Up to $1.05M (Core), $1.2M (Advanced), or $3M (Total) total coverage, including up to $1M for Lawyers and Experts on all plans. Stolen Funds coverage is up to $25K (Core), $100K (Advanced), or $1M (Total).
- **Identity Restoration Specialists:** U.S.-based specialists who assist members with identity recovery, fraud resolution, account restoration, and recovery coordination.
- **Scam Reimbursement:** Reimbursement for eligible scam-related financial losses — up to $5,000 (Advanced) or $10,000 (Total).
- **Scam Support:** Expert guidance and AI-assisted scam detection tools available on Advanced and Total plans.

### AI Protection

- **Card Exposure Control:** Monitors payment card information for signs of exposure, compromise, or unauthorized sharing online.
- **AI Financial Defense:** AI-powered monitoring that detects fraudulent financial activity, suspicious transactions, and account takeover patterns across connected accounts.
- **Unexpected & Suspicious Charge Alerts:** Notifies members of unusual or suspicious transactions on linked accounts.

### Credit & Financial Protection

- **Credit, Checking, and Savings Activity Alerts:** 2 accounts (Core), 5 accounts (Advanced), or unlimited accounts (Total).
- **Credit & Payday Loan Lock:** Helps lock credit and payday loan inquiries to reduce unauthorized account openings. Deactivates if the subscription is downgraded or canceled.
- **Buy Now Pay Later Alerts:** Notifies members of activity related to buy-now-pay-later financing in their name.
- **Utility Account Alerts:** Monitors for new or suspicious utility account activity.
- **Credit Monitoring:** Two-bureau (Core) or three-bureau (Advanced, Total) credit monitoring.
- **Credit Report & Score:** One Bureau Monthly on all plans; Three Bureau Annually added on Advanced and Total; One Bureau Daily added on Total.
- **401(k) / Investment Account Alerts:** Monitors retirement and investment accounts for suspicious activity. Total plan only.
- **Bank Account Takeover Alerts:** Detects signs of attempted bank account takeover. Total plan only.
- **Home Title Monitoring:** Monitors property and deed records for suspicious ownership changes, refinancing activity, fraudulent liens, or other modifications. Total plan only.
- **Phone Takeover Monitoring:** Monitors for SIM swap attempts, unauthorized carrier transfers, and mobile account takeover activity. Total plan only.

### Identity & Privacy Protection

- **Automatic Data Broker Removal:** Scans major data broker and people-search sites and submits opt-out requests approximately every 90 days to reduce online exposure.
- **Identity Verification Alerts:** Notifies members of identity verification events tied to their personal information.
- **Dark Web Monitoring:** Scans dark web forums, marketplaces, breach dumps, and known criminal sources for exposed personal information.
- **Breach Alerts:** Notifies members when major data breaches may have exposed their personal information and provides guidance on protective actions.
- **Social Media Monitoring:** Monitors supported social media platforms for suspicious activity, account compromise indicators, cyberbullying, explicit content, and harmful interactions.

### Support

- **24/7 Virtual Advisor:** AI-powered advisor available around the clock for scam questions, guidance, and identity-related support.
- **24/7 Customer Phone Support:** Standard phone support on Core; **Priority 24/7 Customer Phone Support** on Advanced and Total.
- **Identity Consultation:** One-on-one consultation with a LifeLock specialist. Total plan only.

### Additional Benefits Across Plans

- **Identity Alert System:** LifeLock's proprietary alert system notifying members of suspicious identity-related activity.
- **Stolen Wallet Protection:** Helps replace or cancel stolen credit cards, driver's licenses, Social Security cards, insurance cards, and other sensitive documents.
- **Million Dollar Protection Package:** Up to $1 million for lawyers and experts on eligible plans, plus plan-dependent stolen funds reimbursement and personal expense compensation.
- **Restoration Guarantee:** Reimburses eligible stolen funds, personal expenses, legal fees, and expert costs related to covered identity theft events, subject to terms and limitations.

